%SIXMD 1
# @?OD - DUMP 36-BIT WORDS IN OCTAL

## DESCRIPTION

READS WORDS FROM FILE OR STANDARD INPUT AND PRINTS WORD OFFSET AND 12-DIGIT OCTAL VALUE.

USAGE IS 'OD [FILE]'.

THIS COMMAND IS IMPLEMENTED ENTIRELY IN PDP-6 ASSEMBLER AND IS PART OF THE
OPTIONAL ASMUTILS PACKAGE. IT IS INSTALLED IN /OPTION/BASE/EXEC.

## @?FILES

### @?/OPTION/BASE/EXEC/OD
OPTIONAL EXECUTABLE.

### @?/OPTION/BASE/SOURCE/ASMUTILS/OD.S
ASSEMBLER SOURCE.

